#: content/BE4FOSS/_index.md:9
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "In 2020, the German Environment Agency (German: *Umweltbundesamt*) "
#| "released the award criteria for eco-certifying desktop software with the "
#| "Blue Angel ecolabel (German: *Blauer Engel*). From 2021-2022, the BE4FOSS "
#| "project under KDE Eco worked to advance eco-certification for resource "
#| "and energy-efficient software in FOSS communities. Obtaining the Blue "
#| "Angel ecolabel occurs in 3 steps: (1) Measure, (2) Analyze, and (3) "
#| "Certify."
msgid ""
"In 2020, the German Environment Agency (German: *Umweltbundesamt*) released "
"the award criteria for eco-certifying desktop software with the Blue Angel "
"ecolabel (German: *Blauer Engel*). From 2021–2022, the BE4FOSS project under "
"KDE Eco worked to advance eco-certification for resource and energy-"
"efficient software in FOSS communities. Obtaining the Blue Angel ecolabel "
"occurs in 3 steps: (1) Measure, (2) Analyze, and (3) Certify."
msgstr ""
"Em 2020, a Agência Ambiental Alemã (Em alemão: *Umweltbundesamt*) lançou os "
"critérios de nomeação de 'software' com certificação ecológica, através do "
"emblema ecológico Blue Angel (Em alemão: *Blauer Engel*). Em 2021-2022, o "
"projecto BE4FOSS no KDE Eco foi trabalhando no avanço da certificação "
"ecológica para as aplicações eficientes em termos de recursos e energia nas "
"comunidades FOSS. Obter a certificação Blue Angel ocorre em 3 passos: (1) "
"Medir, (2) Analisar e (3) Certificar."

#: content/BE4FOSS/_index.md:11
msgid "Benefits of obtaining the Blue Angel ecolabel include:"
msgstr "Os benefícios de obter o emblema Blue Angel incluem:"

#: content/BE4FOSS/_index.md:12
msgid ""
"Recognition of reaching high standards for environmentally-friendly software "
"design,"
msgstr ""
"Reconhecimento no alcance de padrões elevados no desenho de 'software' amigo "
"do ambiente,"

#: content/BE4FOSS/_index.md:13
msgid "Differentiating free software from the alternatives,"
msgstr "Diferenciação do 'software' livre face às alternativas."

#: content/BE4FOSS/_index.md:14
msgid "Increasing the appeal of adoption for consumers, and"
msgstr "Aumento do apelo à adopção pelos consumidores e"

#: content/BE4FOSS/_index.md:15
msgid "Promoting transparency in the ecological footprint of software."
msgstr "Promoção da transparência na pegada ecológica das aplicações."

#: content/BE4FOSS/_index.md:17
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Learn more in the KDE Eco handbook \"[Applying The Blue Angel Criteria To "
#| "Free Software](https://eco.kde.org/handbook/)\"."
msgid ""
"Learn more in the KDE Eco handbook “[Applying The Blue Angel Criteria To "
"Free Software](https://eco.kde.org/handbook/)”."
msgstr ""
"Saiba mais no manual do KDE Eco, em \"[Applying The Blue Angel Criteria To "
"Free Software](https://eco.kde.org/handbook/)\"."

