#: content/blog/2024-05-29_introducing-ns4nh.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Sustainable Software Goal"
msgid "Sustainable Software"
msgstr "Objectivo de 'Software' Sustentável"

#: content/blog/2024-05-29_introducing-ns4nh.md:0
